ata exchange</li></ul></div></article><article class="cmp-card"><div class="cmp-head">PROTECTED</div><div class="cmp-body"><strong>Protected for long-term deployment.</strong><p>Enterprise security controls, ongoing support and lifetime hardware warranty* help protect the collection environment over the long term.</p><ul><li>Enterprise security controls</li><li>Ongoing support</li><li>Lifetime hardware warranty*</li></ul></div></article></div><div class="warranty warranty-no-cta compact-warranty"><div class="warranty-badge">LIFETIME<br/>HARDWARE<br/>WARRANTY</div><div><h3>Lifetime Hardware Warranty for Eligible Workday Customers.</h3><p>Long-term hardware protection helps reduce replacement uncertainty and strengthens lifecycle value.</p><small>*Applicable warranty terms and conditions apply.</small></div></div></div></section><section class="mist"><div class="wrap mfg-compact"><div class="mfg-compact-copy"><div class="eyebrow">END-TO-END MANUFACTURING CONTROL</div><h2>More Control from Design Through Production.</h2><p>Engineering, tooling, electronics, assembly and quality control within a broader manufacturing foundation.</p><p>By managing more of the hardware lifecycle across the ZKTeco manufacturing network, we maintain greater control over product quality, availability, scalability and long-term product evolution for enterprise deployments.</p></div><aside aria-label="Atlanta Georgia U.S. manufacturing" class="atlanta-proof"><div aria-hidden="true" class="atlanta-flag">🇺🇸</div><div class="atlanta-tag">U.S. MANUFACTURING</div><h3>Atlanta, Georgia</h3><p>Manufacturing facility now ready for Ultima production.</p></aside></div><div class="wrap"><a class="mfg-gallery-strip" href="manufacturing-facilities"><span><strong>Manufacturing Facilities</strong><small>Explore our manufacturing facilities, production lines and hardware capabilities.</small></span><b>Explore Facilities →</b></a></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="e